# Renders docs/media/finance-demo.gif — run from repo root: vhs docs/media/finance-demo.tape
Output docs/media/finance-demo.gif
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1000
Set Height 560
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Type "# OpenAgentOS: memory turns the second invoice into a zero-touch payment"
Enter
Type "uv run python -m apps.finance.demo 2>/dev/null"
Enter
Sleep 18s
